ProcessingProjection -[hidden]right- RequestKey
RequestKey -[hidden]right- Cleanup
Cleanup -[hidden]right- StagedObject
note bottom of ProcessingProjection
  apply_result() + validate_transition():
  source/owner/attempt checks;
  stale state ignored, equivocation rejected.
  Inbox + projection commit together.
end note
note bottom of Cleanup
  tombstone(): Asset + intent + cancel.
  confirm_cancellation() gates cleanup.
  cleanup_tombstones(): repeated scans.
end note
legend bottom
  Each Asset has 0..1 Projection, 0..* RequestKey, 0..1 CleanupIntent (local Asset FKs).
  RequestKey PK = (owner_id, operation, request_key); Job ID in projection has no Processing FK.
  StagedObject has NO Asset FK; key-based application association, independent orphan lifecycle.
  These records support the business aggregate; none is a member entity just because it shares a transaction.
endlegend

